"""
Multi-Sheet Excel Merger Studio  (v2.3, English UI)

Merges .xlsx/.xlsm/.xlsb/.xls/.csv files from one folder into a single workbook,
sheet by sheet (sheets with the same name are stacked on top of each other).

NEW in 2.3
  * CSV files are now merged TOGETHER with the Excel data (they are stacked into
    the same sheet instead of landing in a separate "CSV_Data" tab).
    By default they go to the first Excel sheet found; you can also type a
    target sheet name in the GUI.
  * After every merge a TXT report is written next to the output file:
    rows read from input files, rows removed (with a breakdown) and rows in
    the output file.

Required: pandas, openpyxl  (optional: xlrd for .xls, pyxlsb for .xlsb)
"""
